{"id":"1c9e1f4290cd3e8c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-cor-continuum.md","title":"Continuum Corollary","display":"cor-continuum — Continuum Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-continuum","aliases":["58-cor-continuum"],"display":"cor-continuum — Continuum Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-continuum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-continuum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-continuum — Continuum Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d080919eadef61c1\" href=\"?note=d080919eadef61c1\" title=\"../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md\">../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,\\aleph_0,\\mathfrak c\\in V\">\\(\\omega,\\aleph_0,\\mathfrak c\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span> is the continuum cardinal (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\mapsto\\mathcal P(A):V\\to V\">\\(A\\mapsto\\mathcal P(A):V\\to V\\)</span> is the power-set operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> is the cardinality operator and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0=|\\omega|\">\\(\\aleph_0=|\\omega|\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=|\\mathcal P(\\omega)|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\mathfrak c\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=|\\mathcal P(\\omega)|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\mathfrak c\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The continuum is uncountable by Cantor's theorem.</li>\n<li>The stronger comparison <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\\leq\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\aleph_1\\leq\\mathfrak c\\)</span> uses cardinal comparability (in particular, Choice in the usual ZFC presentation) and is not claimed from the two dependencies above alone.</li>\n<li>The power-set and cardinality operators are direct semantic dependencies of the displayed equality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md","status":"resolved","id":"d080919eadef61c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega,\\aleph_0,\\mathfrak c\\in V$, where $\\mathfrak c$ is the continuum cardinal (see [[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\mapsto\\mathcal P(A):V\\to V$ is the power-set operator (see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ is the cardinality operator and $\\aleph_0=|\\omega|$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] and [[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ is the cardinality operator and $\\aleph_0=|\\omega|$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] and [[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega,\\aleph_0,\\mathfrak c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c","display":false},{"tex":"A\\mapsto\\mathcal P(A):V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0=|\\omega|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continuum} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=|\\mathcal P(\\omega)|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\land\\aleph_0<\\mathfrak c","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_1\\leq\\mathfrak c","display":false}],"bytes":1283,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-cor-continuum.md|58-cor-continuum]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["d080919eadef61c1","99c5552e170feee3","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","2be08d4ee8aa1590","535817bf563314f5"]}